The [[Manathirst]] is a [[Weapon]] normally obtained by combining the [[Hungry Blade]] with the [[Mana Orb]]. It gains 2 {{icon/mana}} on hit, which is almost guaranteed every 1.4s, making it a great {{icon/mana}} source. It also deals some lifesteal damage when enough {{icon/mana}} is gained from all sources. It uses less stamina than the [[Hungry Blade]], making it a good pair for something like a [[Staff]].

Manathirst's second effect, "'''30 {{icon/mana}} gained:''' activates separately from its regular attacks. It activates one time for every 30 accumulative {{icon/mana}} gained by any of your items. The center of the sword's blade will progressively light up from the hilt to the tip while you spend {{icon/mana}}, when it gets fully lit up, it means you have gained 30 {{icon/mana}} and Manathirst will steal 10 life (or more if you have any {{icon/vampirism}}) and reset the count (and the visual effect of the blade).

The life stealing effect can deal [[critical hits]].

